annot simultaneously be (a) the exactly-two-same complement equal to 162 and (b) a 252-tuple accounting that includes AAA. The target thus presents a contradiction relation whose endpoints are not even consistent within the target's own text.","counterexample":["If 9×2×9 = 162 is the exactly-two-same complement (excluding AAA), then it cannot be the 252-tuple quantity including AAA the refutation clause demands; if instead 9×2×9 = 162 is reinterpreted to include AAA yielding 252, then it was never the exactly-two-same complement and the contradiction premise dissolves."],"target":"5f806d27331d93b26b00a51f7de0b186b329073f354b0fd368909dac7c1fd510"}]}